  "h1": "Income Tax Calculator — Old vs New Regime (AY 2026-27)",
  "metaDescription": "Free India income tax calculator, AY 2026-27: compare old vs new regime with 80C, 80D, HRA, NPS, 87A rebate, surcharge and 4% cess. Nothing uploaded.",
  "intro": "The Income Tax Calculator runs both Indian regimes on the same income and shows which one produces the lower liability. It walks taxable income slab by slab — the AY 2026-27 new-regime bands (nil up to ₹4 lakh, then 5%, 10%, 15%, 20%, 25% and 30% above ₹24 lakh) and the age-based old-regime bands — then applies the Section 87A rebate with marginal relief, surcharge with threshold relief, and 4% health and education cess on top. Every figure is computed in JavaScript on your own device and formatted with Intl.NumberFormat in the en-IN locale; there is no server call, no signup, and your salary figures never leave the page. It is an estimate of regular individual income tax, not tax advice or a filing.",
